[gd_scene load_steps=22 format=3]

; M3-BPR-01: the Terraces of Ash at Lanternfall (Ch5: the pilgrim-stair fights and the Cinder Matron), greybox until
; env-art's Terraces of Ash kit lands (M3-ENV-03/06). Grade from docs/kb/art/color_script.md "Ch5": key #FFA757 lamp
; 1.6 (the Sun node is the lamp key), fill #3A4A6A 0.25, rim #E0702E 0.9, sky #101A33 / #3A2A3A, fog #5A3A2E,
; exposure 1.05, saturation x1.15. A flat volcanic-stone terrace at y = 0 for the fight, stepped terraces climbing
; behind the foes with grave stones and small warm lanterns along their lips, a channel of leaf-boat fires running
; down the steps, and the mountain's dark cone beyond with its plume faintly lit. No Sea (no open water in view).

